### Verifier que book-service repond en bonne sante
GET http://localhost:8091/actuator/health

### Lister tous les livres
GET http://localhost:8091/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Creer un nouveau livre
# @name createBook
POST http://localhost:8091/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fahrenheit 451",
  "author": "Ray Bradbury",
  "isbn": "9782253004420",
  "totalCopies": 2
}

### Recuperer le livre qui vient d'etre cree
GET http://localhost:8091/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Decrementer le stock (simule un emprunt)
PATCH http://localhost:8091/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.id}}/decrement-stock

### Decrementer a nouveau (stock a 0 apres cette requete)
PATCH http://localhost:8091/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.id}}/decrement-stock

### Decrementer une 3e fois -> 409 Conflict (plus aucun exemplaire disponible)
PATCH http://localhost:8091/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.id}}/decrement-stock

### Reincrementer le stock (simule un retour)
PATCH http://localhost:8091/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.id}}/increment-stock

### Cas invalide : titre vide -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8091/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Auteur",
  "isbn": "0000000000000",
  "totalCopies": 1
}

### Cas 404 : livre inexistant
GET http://localhost:8091/api/books/999999
Accept: application/json

### Supprimer le livre cree
DELETE http://localhost:8091/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.id}}
